<BaseLayout locale="en" title="Changelog · GenshinPiano"><section class="page-hero shell"><span class="eyebrow">CHANGELOG</span><h1>Improving every performance</h1><p>Highlights from the v3 rebuild. Release numbers and downloads are always sourced from GitHub Releases.</p></section><section class="section shell"><div class="timeline">{sections.map(([title,items],i)=><article><span class="timeline-dot"></span><div><span class="badge muted">{i===0?'LATEST':'COMPLETE'}</span><h2>{title}</h2><ul>{(items as string[]).map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></div></article>)}</div><div class="center-action"><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/tozyx/GenshinPiano/releases">View all GitHub Releases →</a></div></section></BaseLayout>